    "html": "<p>A particle oscillates with simple harmonic motion (SHM) of amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>. When the displacement of the particle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2A}{3}\"></span>, its kinetic energy is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>. What is the kinetic energy of the object when its displacement is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{9E}{5}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{9E}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9E\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
